  === Complete Solutions
  #sol-item(1, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The definition covers the whole cycle: identify, record, classify, summarise, communicate.
  ]

  #sol-item(2, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Bookkeeping records; accounting also designs, reports and interprets.
  ]
  ]

  #sol-item(3, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Users are those with a decision to make about the firm; a stranger's customer has none.
  ]

  #sol-item(4, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The business is treated as separate from its owner, which is why drawings are not an expense.
  ]

  #sol-item(5, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The going concern assumption justifies cost-based valuation rather than break-up value.
  ]

  #sol-item(6, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Accruals, also called matching, puts each cost in the period that benefited from it.
  ]

  #sol-item(7, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Consistency keeps methods stable so that the accounts of one year can be compared with the next.
  ]

  #sol-item(8, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Prudence provides for known losses but never anticipates profit.
  ]

  #sol-item(9, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Realisation fixes the moment of sale, not the moment of ordering or of payment.
  ]

  #sol-item(10, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    An item too small to affect a decision may be treated in the simplest way.
  ]

  #sol-item(11, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Only what can be measured reliably in money is recorded.
  ]

  #sol-item(12, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Historical cost is objective and verifiable, which is why it survives despite inflation.
  ]

  #sol-item(13, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Objectivity is why source documents matter: an entry without evidence is an opinion.
  ]

  #sol-item(14, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Financial accounting reports to owners, lenders, government and the public.
  ]

  #sol-item(15, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Budgets and decision estimates are forward-looking and internal.
  ]

  #sol-item(16, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Cost accounting builds the cost of output for the manager.
  ]

  #sol-item(17, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The auditor's opinion is on truth and fairness, not on profitability or on the absence of all fraud.
  ]

  #sol-item(18, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The Financial Reporting Council of Nigeria issues and adopts the reporting standards.
  ]

  #sol-item(19, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria is the professional body.
  ]

  #sol-item(20, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The entity concept makes it drawings, which reduce capital rather than profit.
  ]

  #sol-item(21, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Cash comes in (asset up) and the owner's stake rises (capital up).
  ]

  #sol-item(22, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Relevance is the quality of bearing on the decision at hand.
  ]

  #sol-item(23, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Comparability comes from consistent treatment and common standards.
  ]

  #sol-item(24, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Reliability is freedom from bias and material error.
  ]

  #sol-item(25, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    It provides for a loss that is probable rather than waiting for the debt to fail.
  ]

  #sol-item(26, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The cost is matched to the periods that use the machine.
  ]

  #sol-item(27, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Changing method to flatter profit destroys comparability.
  ]

  #sol-item(28, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Accounts are drawn for a year, a half-year or a quarter although the business continues.
  ]

  #sol-item(29, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Every transaction has two effects, which is double entry.
  ]

  #sol-item(30, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    A position at a date is the balance sheet; the others cover a period.
  ]

  #sol-item(31, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Income less expenses over a period is the profit and loss account.
  ]

  #sol-item(32, "B", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Rearranging the equation gives capital = assets − liabilities.
  ]

  #sol-item(33, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The manager works inside the firm and needs management accounting.
  ]

  #sol-item(34, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The lender's question is repayment and interest.
  ]

  #sol-item(35, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The information exists so that users can decide.
  ]

  #sol-item(36, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Only materiality is matched correctly; the others are reversed or wrong.
  ]

  #sol-item(37, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Private spending is drawings under the entity concept.
  ]

  #sol-item(38, "C", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    It is the medium through which business results are communicated.
  ]

  #sol-item(39, "A", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    Historical cost figures become misleading during inflation.
  ]

  #sol-item(40, "D", dense: true, pad: 10.94pt)[
    The business is accounted for as a person separate from its owner.
  ]

]

